      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like droidstubs can pass \"--min-sdk-version\u003dcurrent\" (or \"platform_apis\"). \n\nAIDL compiler uses min_sdk_version ...\n- to reject unsupported AIDL feature when compiling against older SDK version\n- to generate code using newer APIs or fallback to fill-in implementation.\n\nFor the first one, droidstubs doesn\u0027t need to reject any input .aidl files.\n\nFor the second one, droidstubs doesn\u0027t care how the code is implemented.",
